title: Start
---
<<declare $met_before = false>>
<<if $met_before>>
    Shopkeeper: Back again? You've got {coins()} coins.
<<else>>
    Shopkeeper: Hey, you're new here. Welcome to the workshop!
    <<set $met_before to true>>
<<endif>>
Shopkeeper: What do you want to know?
-> What is Yarn Spinner?
    <<jump WhatIsYarn>>
-> Can I have some coins?
    <<jump Coins>>
-> Nothing, bye.
    Shopkeeper: See you around.
===

title: WhatIsYarn
---
Shopkeeper: It's a way to write dialogue like a screenplay.
Shopkeeper: Lines, choices, and jumps between nodes. Writers never have to open a script.
Shopkeeper: Open Shopkeeper.yarn and change what I say. Then press Play again.
===

title: Coins
---
Shopkeeper: Sure, here's three.
<<give_coins 3>>
Shopkeeper: That line ran a command in the game code. Check the counter in the corner.
===
